(7544088, 1207777, 30049, '<td valign="top">:-)  I took a photo quite similar but ended up using a different one.  I like the colorful shoes in contrast.  Have to scroll a ways to get to them however.  Maybe a square crop would have grabbed interest / shown off that feature sooner.  Overall, I like it.  Good luck.</td>', ':-)  I took a photo quite similar but ended up using a different one.  I like the colorful shoes in contrast.  Have to scroll a ways to get to them however.  Maybe a square crop would have grabbed interest / shown off that feature sooner.  Overall, I like it.  Good luck.', '2017-11-12 11:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544089, 1207836, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hate when that happens!  :-)  Grab the hiking boots and start moving, you know that best shot is just up around the corner.</td>', 'Hate when that happens!  :-)  Grab the hiking boots and start moving, you know that best shot is just up around the corner.', '2017-11-12 11:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544090, 1207739, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge theme well but still somewhat interesting.  That''s the hard part for this one.  Things that are wet can be difficult.  A CP could have knocked those reflections out for you and made the colors richer.</td>', 'Fits the challenge theme well but still somewhat interesting.  That''s the hard part for this one.  Things that are wet can be difficult.  A CP could have knocked those reflections out for you and made the colors richer.', '2017-11-12 11:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544091, 1207785, 30049, '<td valign="top">My fav of the challenge thus far.  Nicely seen and captured.</td>', 'My fav of the challenge thus far.  Nicely seen and captured.', '2017-11-12 11:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544098, 1207240, 50864, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful light</td>', 'Very beautiful light', '2017-11-12 12:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544099, 1207246, 50864, '<td valign="top">Great lines and light.</td>', 'Great lines and light.', '2017-11-12 12:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544110, 1207767, 30861, '<td valign="top">I have mixed feelings about this, as far as the *challenge* goes: a cup of tea with milk is certainly mundane, but the is an extraordinary glass and saucer. It''s very well done technically, except I wish the handle could be sharper. The bubbles are perfect, the lighting is terrific. In the end, an 8 from me.</td>', 'I have mixed feelings about this, as far as the *challenge* goes: a cup of tea with milk is certainly mundane, but the is an extraordinary glass and saucer. It''s very well done technically, except I wish the handle could be sharper. The bubbles are perfect, the lighting is terrific. In the end, an 8 from me.', '2017-11-12 15:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544111, 1207763, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gotta love this one. Gotta love it a lot. I''m sure it''s ordinary wherever YOU are, whoever you are, and of course it SAYS it''s ordinary, right on the green box, but it''s an extraordinary mailbox :-) 8 from me.</td>', 'Gotta love this one. Gotta love it a lot. I''m sure it''s ordinary wherever YOU are, whoever you are, and of course it SAYS it''s ordinary, right on the green box, but it''s an extraordinary mailbox :-) 8 from me.', '2017-11-12 15:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544112, 1207857, 30861, '<td valign="top">A dog, a cat, a door... BORRING... Right? Wrong! What an exceptional seeing of the mundane! 8 from me.</td>', 'A dog, a cat, a door... BORRING... Right? Wrong! What an exceptional seeing of the mundane! 8 from me.', '2017-11-12 15:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544113, 1207842, 30861, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like this much at first, but now I do, a lot. It just took a little time to appreciate the in-your-face banality of the scene. The billboard makes it. 8 from me.</td>', 'I didn''t like this much at first, but now I do, a lot. It just took a little time to appreciate the in-your-face banality of the scene. The billboard makes it. 8 from me.', '2017-11-12 15:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544121, 1207808, 50695, '<td valign="top">so few finding the ghost in the ordinary. you did</td>', 'so few finding the ghost in the ordinary. you did', '2017-11-12 19:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544122, 1207852, 50695, '<td valign="top">I find this charming for some reason.</td>', 'I find this charming for some reason.', '2017-11-12 19:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544123, 1207246, 50695, '<td valign="top">good emptiness</td>', 'good emptiness', '2017-11-12 19:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544124, 1207240, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favorite entry. Gives me the impession of a lazy morning, lolling around in bed and getting up whenever I feel like it. Bumping this one a notch.</td>', 'I think this is my favorite entry. Gives me the impession of a lazy morning, lolling around in bed and getting up whenever I feel like it. Bumping this one a notch.', '2017-11-12 19:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544126, 1207785, 97225, '<td valign="top">Ordinary, yet not. Nice find. I like the wet tread-marks.</td>', 'Ordinary, yet not. Nice find. I like the wet tread-marks.', '2017-11-12 20:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544128, 1207784, 97225, '<td valign="top">Ordinary, but beautiful. You have made the most of the commonplace. Top shot.</td>', 'Ordinary, but beautiful. You have made the most of the commonplace. Top shot.', '2017-11-12 20:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544132, 1207646, 76217, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge but I am not exactly sure why. I can''t tell if it is highly processed or not processed at all.Is is it shadow or real? Is it an imprint? Perhaps a shroud? It is skeletal. It is substantial.It is flat at first viewing but becomes multi-dimensional. It is like a tunnel. The edge of an abyss. I too am a fan.</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge but I am not exactly sure why. I can''t tell if it is highly processed or not processed at all.Is is it shadow or real? Is it an imprint? Perhaps a shroud? It is skeletal. It is substantial.It is flat at first viewing but becomes multi-dimensional. It is like a tunnel. The edge of an abyss. I too am a fan.', '2017-11-12 21:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544133, 1207293, 76217, '<td valign="top">This is well done. Mundane need not be drab and dreary. This entry really stands out.</td>', 'This is well done. Mundane need not be drab and dreary. This entry really stands out.', '2017-11-12 21:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7544134, 1207857, 76217, '<td valign="top">I must admit I have a difficult time judging "pet" pictures.I will freely call it a prejudice. Normally when I see cat or dog I give it a 5 and move on. There is something about this image, however, that is appealing. It is not a portrait. It is a well seen and well balanced, interesting and artistic composition. Very well done.</td>', 'I must admit I have a difficult time judging "pet" pictures.I will freely call it a prejudice. Normally when I see cat or dog I give it a 5 and move on. There is something about this image, however, that is appealing. It is not a portrait. It is a well seen and well balanced, interesting and artistic composition. Very well done.', '2017-11-12 21:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
